{"seq":5,"slug":"planetary-science","title":"行星科学","stage":"DONE","category":"astronomy-cosmology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.25,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"行星科学\">行星科学</h1><p>行星科学（Planetary Science）是研究太阳系及系外行星系统中行星、卫星、小天体等天体的形成、演化、结构与环境的综合性学科。它融合了天文学、地球科学、物理学、化学和生物学的方法，致力于理解行星世界的多样性与宜居性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学科范畴\">学科范畴</h2><p>行星科学涵盖从太阳系起源到系外行星探测的广泛领域：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>太阳系形成与演化</strong> — 原行星盘理论、行星迁移模型、小天体记录的早期太阳系信息</li>\n<li><strong>类地行星</strong> — 行星内部结构、大气动力学、地质活动与火星探测前沿</li>\n<li><strong>巨行星与卫星系统</strong> — 气态/冰巨行星物理、海洋世界的地下海洋与生命潜力</li>\n<li><strong>系外行星</strong> — 探测方法、大气表征、宜居带理论与生物标志物搜寻</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-结构\">本 Hub 结构</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一章</td>\n<td>太阳系形成</td>\n<td>原行星盘、行星形成模型、小天体与陨石</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二章</td>\n<td>类地行星</td>\n<td>内部结构、大气科学、火星探测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三章</td>\n<td>巨行星与卫星</td>\n<td>气态/冰巨行星、海洋世界、土星系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四章</td>\n<td>系外行星</td>\n<td>探测方法、大气表征、宜居性与生物标志物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>当前行星科学正处于黄金时代：JWST 革命性地揭示系外行星大气成分；ESA Juice 任务（2023年发射）正飞往木星冰卫星；NASA Europa Clipper（2024年发射）将详细探测木卫二的冰下海洋；中国天问系列持续推进火星与小行星探测。这些任务正在重塑我们对行星系统多样性和生命起源的理解。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solar-system-formation","title":"太阳系形成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"protoplanetary-disk","title":"原行星盘：太阳系的诞生摇篮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation/protoplanetary-disk"},{"seq":2,"slug":"planet-formation-models","title":"行星形成模型：从尘埃到行星","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation/planet-formation-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"small-bodies-meteorites","title":"小天体与陨石：太阳系的化石记录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation/small-bodies-meteorites"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"terrestrial-planets","title":"类地行星","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/terrestrial-planets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"planetary-interiors","title":"行星内部结构：揭示岩石行星的深层世界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/terrestrial-planets/planetary-interiors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"planetary-atmospheres","title":"行星大气：比较行星气候学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/terrestrial-planets/planetary-atmospheres"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mars-exploration","title":"火星探测科学：从轨道到地表的深度认知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/terrestrial-planets/mars-exploration"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"giant-planets-moons","title":"巨行星与卫星","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/giant-planets-moons","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gas-ice-giants","title":"气态与冰巨行星：太阳系的引力巨人","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/giant-planets-moons/gas-ice-giants"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ocean-worlds","title":"海洋世界：Europa 与 Enceladus 的冰下海洋","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/giant-planets-moons/ocean-worlds"},{"seq":3,"slug":"titan-saturn-system","title":"土卫六与土星系统：甲烷世界的异域化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/giant-planets-moons/titan-saturn-system"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"exoplanets","title":"系外行星","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/exoplanets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"detection-methods","title":"系外行星探测方法：发现其他世界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/exoplanets/detection-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"exoplanet-atmospheres","title":"系外行星大气表征：JWST 时代的光谱革命","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/exoplanets/exoplanet-atmospheres"},{"seq":3,"slug":"habitability-biosignatures","title":"宜居性与生物标志物：寻找地外生命的科学框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/exoplanets/habitability-biosignatures"}]}]}